@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
scale max 800 width
skinparam padding 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

title 3.3 — Compliance Audit: OMCS Pipeline (CAS + VAS + HCS)

actor Operator as O
participant "SmartOptimization\nBoard" as UI
participant "Compliance\nController" as CC
participant "ComplianceAnalysis\nService" as CAS
participant "FastAPI\n(SBERT + Groq)" as FP
participant "tbl_compliance_\nevaluation_result" as DB
participant "tbl_compliance_\nrevision_history" as RH

== 1. Initiate Audit ==

O -> UI: Upload media + edit caption\nToggle "Activate Audit"
UI -> UI: Validate caption non-empty\nStart progress bar timer (160ms increments)

UI -> CC: POST /api/v1/compliance/evaluate-full-json\n{caption, market, mediaName, mediaSize, ?profileId}

== 2. Context Retrieval (FR3.21) ==

CC -> CAS: analyze(req, profileId)

CAS -> CAS: fetchApprovedCaptions(profileId, market)\n(query tbl_localized_promotional_content\nWHERE approval_status = true)

CAS -> CAS: fetchCreativeContext(profileId, market)\n(query tbl_creative_direction_output\nfor visual_tone + shot_list_recommendations)

CAS -> CAS: fetchBusinessCategories(profileId)\n(query tbl_business_profile for HCS Rule 1)

== 3. Pipeline Routing (FR3.30) ==

alt enriched context available (approvedCaptions not empty)
  CAS -> FP: POST /internal/compliance/evaluate-full\n{caption, market, approvedCaptions,\ncategories, visualTone, shotListContext,\nmediaName, mediaSize}

  note right of FP
    Full OMCS Pipeline:

    CAS — Caption Alignment Score (35%):
      E5 encode caption + each approved caption
      max cosine similarity × 100
      Fallback: keyword overlap if E5 unavailable

    VAS — Visual Alignment Score (45%):
      Groq evaluates 5 criteria holistically:
        1. Composition consistency
        2. Cultural appropriateness
        3. Visual tone alignment
        4. Subject emphasis
        5. Destination relevance
      Fallback: Korea=74, Japan=76, USA=71

    HCS — Heuristic Compliance Score (20%):
      6 deterministic rules (always succeeds):
        Rule 1 — Tourism category alignment (20pts)
        Rule 2 — Market cultural consistency (20pts)
        Rule 3 — Seasonal appropriateness (20pts)
        Rule 4 — Promotional tone conformity (15pts)
        Rule 5 — Recommendation adherence (15pts)
        Rule 6 — Caption-visual consistency (10pts)

    OMCS = (0.35 × CAS) + (0.45 × VAS) + (0.20 × HCS)
  end note

  alt FastAPI success
    FP --> CAS: ComplianceResponse\n{casScore, vasScore, hcsScore, omcsScore,\naligned, gaps, mismatches, source}
  else FastAPI 5xx / timeout (AF3.3)
    FP --> CAS: error / timeout
    CAS -> FP: POST /internal/compliance/evaluate\n[re-route to basic Groq single-score]
    FP --> CAS: ComplianceResponse\n{score, interpretation, aligned, gaps}
  end

else no approved captions (basic path)
  CAS -> FP: POST /internal/compliance/evaluate\n{caption, market, mediaName, mediaSize}
  FP --> CAS: ComplianceResponse\n{score, interpretation, aligned, gaps}
end

== 4. Persist Result (FR3.29) ==

CAS -> CAS: calcRevisionNumber(profileId, market)\n= MAX(revision_number) + 1\n(or 1 on first submission)

CAS -> DB: INSERT tbl_compliance_evaluation_result\n{cas_score, vas_score, hcs_score, omcs_score,\ncompliance_threshold, aligned_items, gap_items,\nmismatches, revision_number}

alt revision_number > 1
  CAS -> RH: INSERT tbl_compliance_revision_history\n{original_eval_id, revision_number,\nsubmitted_caption, cas_score, omcs_score}

  note right of RH
    Created only on resubmissions.
    original_eval_id FK links back to
    the first evaluation for lineage tracking.
  end note
end

DB --> CAS: saved entity
CAS --> CC: ComplianceResultDto
CC --> UI: ComplianceResultDto\n{omcsScore, casScore, vasScore, hcsScore,\ncompliance Threshold, aligned, gaps, mismatches}

== 5. Display Results ==

UI -> UI: Progress bar reaches 100%
UI -> UI: Render ComplianceGauge (OMCS 0-100)\n+ Interpretation badge\n+ CAS / VAS / HCS sub-score chips\n+ FeedbackList (What Works / What Needs Improvement)\n+ Detected Mismatches panel (full pipeline only)

@enduml
